ng-[-0.02em] md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.6rem]" data-mdlfy-cms="insights:c74ac840-3798-4008-882c-478b5bca6df2:title">Express, priority or economy: picking an air freight service level</h1><p class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/60"><span>Published</span><time datetime="2026-09-15">September 15, 2026</time><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1 bg-brand-soft"></span><span>Meridian Freight team</span></p></div></header><div class="bg-white pb-24 pt-12 md:pb-32 md:pt-16" data-header-theme="light"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[90rem] px-5 md:px-8 lg:px-10"><img alt="A jet parked on an airport apron beside a large aircraft hangar" class="aspect-[16/9] w-full rounded-3xl object-cover md:aspect-[21/9]" decoding="async" src="/images/meridian/airport-apron.jpg"/><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl pt-12 md:pt-16"><p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-foreground md:text-2xl" data-mdlfy-cms="insights:c74ac840-3798-4008-882c-478b5bca6df2:excerpt">Air freight is not one product. Matching the service level to the urgency of your cargo can save money without putting deadlines at risk.</p><div class="rich-text mt-10 border-t pt-10"><p>Air freight is the fastest way to move goods between continents, but not every air shipment needs the next available flight. Most forwarders offer several service levels, and the difference in price between them can be significant.</p><h2>Express</h2><p>Express services put your cargo on the first suitable flight with priority handling at both ends. They suit production line stoppages, urgent spare parts and launch stock, where a missed day costs more than the freight.</p><h2>Priority</h2><p>Priority services travel on direct or near-direct routings with confirmed space, without the premium of next-flight-out handling. They work well for regular replenishment of high-value or fast-moving stock.</p><h2>Economy and consolidated</h2><p>Economy services consolidate cargo from several shippers and may use connecting flights. Transit takes longer, but rates are noticeably lower, which makes them a good fit for goods that need to arrive faster than ocean freight allows without being urgent.</p><h2>How air freight is charged</h2><p>Airlines charge on whichever is greater: the actual weight or the volumetric weight. Volumetric weight is commonly calculated by dividing the cargo volume in cubic centimetres by 6,000. Light but bulky goods are therefore charged on their size, so tight, well-planned packaging can cut costs.</p><ul><li>Confirm the real deadline before choosing a service level.</li><li>Share accurate dimensions and weights when you ask for a quote.</li><li>Check whether your goods are classed as dangerous goods, such as lithium batteries, before booking.</li></ul></div><div class="mt-16 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t pt-8"><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] transition-colors hover:text-brand" href="/meridian/insights"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-left size-3.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"></path><path d="M19 12H5"></path></svg>All insights</a><a class="group inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-full font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.14em] whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-300 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-60 bg-ink text-white hover:bg-brand focus-visible:outline-ink h-10 px-5 text-[11px]" href="/meridian/contact">Talk to our team<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-3.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fi