sights:4bf8b293-4f72-41f6-b760-57ba1cacd285:title">What a licensed customs broker actually does for importers</h3><p class="mt-4 line-clamp-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground" data-mdlfy-cms="insights:4bf8b293-4f72-41f6-b760-57ba1cacd285:excerpt">Classification, valuation, duty and biosecurity all have to line up before goods are released. Here is what a broker handles on your behalf.</p><span class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-2 pt-10 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] transition-colors group-hover:text-brand">Read article<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-3.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></li><li><a class="group flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border border-ink/10 bg-white p-7 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-ink md:p-8" href="/meridian/insights/planning-project-cargo-permits-surveys-and-load-engineering"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3"><span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-foreground" data-mdlfy-cms="insights:6eab6307-7ed1-4398-aaf3-e5d3ff81c5e7:category">Project Cargo</span><span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground">September 8, 2026</span></div><h3 class="mt-10 font-heading text-lg uppercase leading-snug tracking-[-0.01em] transition-colors group-hover:text-brand md:text-xl" data-mdlfy-cms="insights:6eab6307-7ed1-4398-aaf3-e5d3ff81c5e7:title">Planning project cargo: permits, surveys and load engineering</h3><p class="mt-4 line-clamp-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground" data-mdlfy-cms="insights:6eab6307-7ed1-4398-aaf3-e5d3ff81c5e7:excerpt">Oversized and heavy lift shipments succeed or fail in the planning stage. These are the steps that keep a complex move on schedule.</p><span class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-2 pt-10 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] transition-colors group-hover:text-brand">Read article<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-3.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></li></ul></div></section><section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-ink py-28 text-white md:py-40" data-header-theme="dark" id="get-started"><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-grid-dark absolute inset-0 -z-10 [mask-image:radial-gradient(65%_60%_at_50%_55%,black,transparent)]"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="cta-glow absolute -inset-x-1/4 bottom-0 -z-10 h-2/3 bg-[radial-gradient(40%_70%_at_50%_100%,rgba(35,64,255,0.55),transparent_75%)]"></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[90rem] px-5 md:px-8 lg:px-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-white/60"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 shrink-0 bg-brand-soft"></span>Work with us</p><h2 class="reveal mt-6 max-w-4xl font-heading text-[2.3rem] uppercase leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.02em] md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Let's get your freight moving.</h2><p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70">Talk to people who have run freight for years and will own your shipment from the first quote to the final delivery.</p><div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3"><a class="group inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-full font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.14em] whitespace-nowrap trans